  "name": "byteorder",
  "description": "This crate provides low-level primitives for encoding and decoding numeric types with explicit big-endian or little-endian byte ordering. It implements a set of extension traits for standard input/output interfaces, enabling seamless integration with stream-based data processing workflows. Designed for systems-level performance, it supports no_std environments and includes optimized routines for fixed-width and arbitrary-width integer types.",
